     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I would like to construct a binomial regression model in Stan using the Jeffery&#39;s prior (see <a href=\"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC2680313/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC2680313/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465090881000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2mwMrWjQ7JWUuUiGa-y01F\">http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC2680313/</a>) as part of my research efforts. I am not quite sure how to complete coding this model. Here is what I have so far.<div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> X</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> asset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> zero</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> XT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>parameters </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> beta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>transformed parameters </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> W</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> XTWX</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> pvec</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  real lp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  real log_lp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  W </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> zero</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    pvec</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">exp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">beta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> beta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">X</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> beta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">X</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> beta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">X</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> beta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">X</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> beta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">X</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> beta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">X</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)));</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    W</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> pvec</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]*(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pvec</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  XTWX </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> XT </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> W </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> X</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  lp </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> determinant</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">XTWX</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  log_lp </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">log</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> binomial_logit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">asset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> X </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> beta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>I think I am more or less on the right track. I construct the prior log_lp = 0.5 * log( |XT * W * X| ) in the transformed parameters block and now my hangup is how exactly to apply this prior to my beta vector. By the paper cited above we know that,</div><div><br></div><div>pi(beta|X) propto |XT*W*X|^{1/2}</div><div><br></div><div>Where XT is simply the transpose of the design matrix X.</div><div><br></div><div>Any help would be greatly appreciated.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div><br></div><div>Nathan</div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
